Sorry for that.

313
00:17:56.875 --> 00:17:59.167
Two days ago, there was a storm here.

314
00:17:59.292 --> 00:18:00.625
Big, like thunderstorm.

315
00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:03.000
Since then the internet is poyi...

316
