there's so much to write about.

345
00:19:07.667 --> 00:19:08.667
Like...

346
00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:12.417
Like the people, the cuisine, the
culture... and especially Pongal.

347
00:19:12.542 --> 00:19:13.375
Pongal?

348
