374
00:20:47.584 --> 00:20:48.500
Hi.

375
00:20:48.584 --> 00:20:49.584
Hi.

376
00:20:49.959 --> 00:20:53.542
Yeah, so...
do you guys have a memory foam mattress?

377
00:20:53.792 --> 00:20:55.959
