1941
01:57:16.334 --> 01:57:19.459
Your generation's stopped trusting
your own feelings.

1942
01:57:20.584 --> 01:57:22.167
Don't make that mistake.

1943
01:57:26.334 --> 01:57:30.250
Once you're on that plane,

1944
01:57:31.667 --> 01:57:33.334
